flowchart TD
    A["Platform creates master template"] --> B["Validate type, definition and protection rules"]
    B --> C["Publish immutable master version"]
    C --> D["Organization Enablement authorizes access"]
    D --> E["Clone into independent organization draft"]
    E --> F["Customize permitted content and publish"]
    F --> G["Domain runtime uses exact published version"]
    C --> H["Platform publishes a newer master version"]
    H --> I["Organization explicitly adopts into a new draft"]
    I --> F